sk expects me to use the market price of silver at those times, not inflation-adjusted. \n\nI'll investigate potential sources for historical silver price data. The specific dates require careful verification, as they might represent monthly averages or specific points in time. I'll need to cross-reference multiple sources to ensure accuracy, potentially using financial databases or historical economic records.\n","signature":""},{"type":"toolRequest","id":"call_9e5f8a2f12b24b04bca2f24c","toolCall":{"status":"success","value":{"name":"shell","arguments":{"command":"curl -s \"https://www.inflationdata.com/inflation/inflation_rate/historical_silver_prices.asp\" 2>/dev/null | head -100 || echo \"Cannot access directly\""}}},"_meta":{"goose_extension":"developer"}}],"metadata":{"userVisible":true,"agentVisible":true}}}
